     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">Hi all,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">I am trying to do model averaging on two models, and I want to use predict() on raster data. Is it possible? I am getting the error below, but I don&#39;t know what it means. Raster seems to have the same dimensions. What does it means?</div><span class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\"></span><br><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/unmarked/attach/72b0ad4bfa16/Screenshot%202024-07-04%20at%206.43.32%E2%80%AFPM.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-07-04 at 6.43.32 PM.png\" width=\"542\" height=\"98\"><br><div><br></div><div><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/unmarked/attach/72b0ad4bfa16/Screenshot%202024-07-04%20at%206.44.42%E2%80%AFPM.png?part=0.2&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-07-04 at 6.44.42 PM.png\" width=\"542\" height=\"44\"><br></div><div><br></div><div><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/unmarked/attach/72b0ad4bfa16/Screenshot%202024-07-04%20at%206.45.16%E2%80%AFPM.png?part=0.4&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-07-04 at 6.45.16 PM.png\" width=\"542\" height=\"139\"><br></div><div><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/unmarked/attach/72b0ad4bfa16/Screenshot%202024-07-04%20at%206.44.59%E2%80%AFPM.png?part=0.3&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-07-04 at 6.44.59 PM.png\" width=\"542\" height=\"133\"><br></div><span class=\"gmail_signature_prefix\">-- </span><br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><b style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">Airy Adriana Peralta</b><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><div style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">Ph. D. Candidate &amp; Professional Aide</div><div style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">Ecology and Evolutionary Biology</div></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">Institute of Arctic and Alpine Research - CU Boulder</div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><div style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Airy.Gonza...@colorado.edu</a></div></div><div><br></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
