   "subject": "Re: Error using predict(FitList) on new data",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div>There was a bug with predicting from rasters using a fitList. It should be fixed now in the dev version of the package. You can install it with<br></div><div><br></div><div>remotes::install_github(&quot;rbchan/unmarked&quot;)<br></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
